<https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-rules/>
  a skos:ConceptScheme ;
  skos:prefLabel "Taxonomy | Core | Rules"@en ;
  skos:editorialNote "Verizon Knowledge Engineering acknowledges that subject area matter content contained within this taxonomy was created with the assistance of VZGPT (vzgpt.verizon.com). " ;
  dct:description "The rules taxonomy categorizes business rules based on their purpose and execution.  It helps to define and constrain relationships between entities, ensuring data integrity, automate decision-making by evaluating conditions and executing actions based on predefined logic and control the order and execution of tasks within a business process, ensuring consistent and predictable outcomes."@en ;
  dct:title "Taxonomy | Core | Rules"@en ;
